  "Comprehensive Reporting and Analytics": "Informes y análisis completos",
  "The Cart Quantity module also offers comprehensive reporting and analytics to help you make informed decisions about your inventory. Detailed reports on stock levels, sales trends, and cart activity provide valuable insights into customer behavior and product performance. With this data, you can optimize your inventory management strategies, improve your supply chain, and enhance overall operational efficiency.": "El módulo Cantidad del carrito también ofrece informes y análisis completos para ayudarlo a tomar decisiones informadas sobre su inventario. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Experience": "Experiencia del cliente mejorada",
  "Providing a seamless shopping experience is essential for customer satisfaction and retention. The Cart Quantity module improves the customer experience by clearly displaying available stock levels and preventing the addition of out-of-stock items to the cart. Customers can shop with confidence, knowing that the items they select are available for purchase. This transparency builds trust and encourages repeat business.": "Proporcionar una experiencia de compra perfecta es esencial para la satisfacción y retención del cliente. ",
  "Real-Time Quantity Updates": "Actualizaciones de cantidades en tiempo real",
  "The Cart Quantity module offers real-time updates to your inventory, ensuring that customers always see the most current stock levels. As soon as an item is added to a cart, the available quantity is adjusted, providing an accurate reflection of what is in stock. This feature reduces the risk of customer frustration due to unavailable products and enhances the overall shopping experience. To utilize these features, it is necessary to enable the cart quantity control button from the store settings.": "El módulo Cantidad del carrito ofrece actualizaciones en tiempo real de su inventario, lo que garantiza que los clientes siempre vean los niveles de existencias más recientes. ",
  "Dynamic Stock Alerts": "Alertas de acciones dinámicas",
  "To further streamline inventory management, the Cart Quantity module includes dynamic stock alerts. When stock levels for a particular item reach a predefined threshold, notifications are automatically generated, prompting timely restocking. This proactive approach helps ensure that popular items are always available, preventing lost sales and maximizing revenue opportunities.": "Para optimizar aún más la gestión de inventario, el módulo Cantidad del carrito incluye alertas dinámicas de stock. ",
